{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-blog-post-js","path":"/004-leading-cast-of-tools/","result":{"data":{"site":{"siteMetadata":{"title":"Wood Times"}},"markdownRemark":{"id":"9450d3aa-3503-5eb5-9cab-dded12214fdc","excerpt":"With a shop space secured and a bench in place, it was time to populate the shop with its leading cast of characters: the power tools. The crown jewel arrived…","html":"<p>With a shop space secured and a bench in place, it was time to populate the shop with its leading cast of characters: the power tools.</p>\n<p>The crown jewel arrived first: a SawStop contractor saw. If you’re going to invest in one serious tool, make it the table saw. It’s the heart of most woodworking operations, and the SawStop’s flesh-detecting brake technology meant I could sleep at night knowing my fingers were protected by more than just careful attention.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/52e1bf62e31aefd227bc4a9de8754037/2a4bc/sawstop_packaging.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 75.31645569620254%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"SawStop Packaging\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/52e1bf62e31aefd227bc4a9de8754037/f058b/sawstop_packaging.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/52e1bf62e31aefd227bc4a9de8754037/c26ae/sawstop_packaging.png 158w,\n/static/52e1bf62e31aefd227bc4a9de8754037/6bdcf/sawstop_packaging.png 315w,\n/static/52e1bf62e31aefd227bc4a9de8754037/f058b/sawstop_packaging.png 630w,\n/static/52e1bf62e31aefd227bc4a9de8754037/40601/sawstop_packaging.png 945w,\n/static/52e1bf62e31aefd227bc4a9de8754037/78612/sawstop_packaging.png 1260w,\n/static/52e1bf62e31aefd227bc4a9de8754037/2a4bc/sawstop_packaging.png 3264w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>The packaging was meticulous, with every component carefully organized. Assembly instructions that actually made sense… a refreshing change from some flat-pack furniture experiences.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/f65537b68ec1385decc59b70e7891ef8/2a4bc/sawstop.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 75.31645569620254%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"SawStop\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/f65537b68ec1385decc59b70e7891ef8/f058b/sawstop.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/f65537b68ec1385decc59b70e7891ef8/c26ae/sawstop.png 158w,\n/static/f65537b68ec1385decc59b70e7891ef8/6bdcf/sawstop.png 315w,\n/static/f65537b68ec1385decc59b70e7891ef8/f058b/sawstop.png 630w,\n/static/f65537b68ec1385decc59b70e7891ef8/40601/sawstop.png 945w,\n/static/f65537b68ec1385decc59b70e7891ef8/78612/sawstop.png 1260w,\n/static/f65537b68ec1385decc59b70e7891ef8/2a4bc/sawstop.png 3264w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>Once assembled, the SawStop commanded its corner of the shop with authority.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/88bc3f9d23b254b30ebc3fca47ca66a6/2ef06/bandsaw.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 133.54430379746836%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"Bandsaw\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/88bc3f9d23b254b30ebc3fca47ca66a6/f058b/bandsaw.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/88bc3f9d23b254b30ebc3fca47ca66a6/c26ae/bandsaw.png 158w,\n/static/88bc3f9d23b254b30ebc3fca47ca66a6/6bdcf/bandsaw.png 315w,\n/static/88bc3f9d23b254b30ebc3fca47ca66a6/f058b/bandsaw.png 630w,\n/static/88bc3f9d23b254b30ebc3fca47ca66a6/40601/bandsaw.png 945w,\n/static/88bc3f9d23b254b30ebc3fca47ca66a6/78612/bandsaw.png 1260w,\n/static/88bc3f9d23b254b30ebc3fca47ca66a6/2ef06/bandsaw.png 2448w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>A Craftsman bandsaw joined the crew next. While not the fanciest option, it was only $250 at the Sears going out of business sale. Sometimes a good workhorse beats a show pony.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/d35435d97cb9ae128fb0b72f11555dc6/2ef06/drill_press.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 133.54430379746836%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"Drill Press\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/d35435d97cb9ae128fb0b72f11555dc6/f058b/drill_press.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/d35435d97cb9ae128fb0b72f11555dc6/c26ae/drill_press.png 158w,\n/static/d35435d97cb9ae128fb0b72f11555dc6/6bdcf/drill_press.png 315w,\n/static/d35435d97cb9ae128fb0b72f11555dc6/f058b/drill_press.png 630w,\n/static/d35435d97cb9ae128fb0b72f11555dc6/40601/drill_press.png 945w,\n/static/d35435d97cb9ae128fb0b72f11555dc6/78612/drill_press.png 1260w,\n/static/d35435d97cb9ae128fb0b72f11555dc6/2ef06/drill_press.png 2448w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>The Porter Cable drill press filled a surprisingly important role. Precision holes at perfect angles.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/87a6df5514ffebebdf84879ef59ea7f6/2a4bc/jointer.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 75.31645569620254%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"Jointer\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/87a6df5514ffebebdf84879ef59ea7f6/f058b/jointer.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/87a6df5514ffebebdf84879ef59ea7f6/c26ae/jointer.png 158w,\n/static/87a6df5514ffebebdf84879ef59ea7f6/6bdcf/jointer.png 315w,\n/static/87a6df5514ffebebdf84879ef59ea7f6/f058b/jointer.png 630w,\n/static/87a6df5514ffebebdf84879ef59ea7f6/40601/jointer.png 945w,\n/static/87a6df5514ffebebdf84879ef59ea7f6/78612/jointer.png 1260w,\n/static/87a6df5514ffebebdf84879ef59ea7f6/2a4bc/jointer.png 3264w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>The Rikon jointer became my gateway to working with rough lumber. That first flat face and square edge it produces is where every good project begins. The helical cutterhead made for whisper-quiet operation and glass-smooth results.  One day, I’ll get a real one, but I don’t have enough room for anything but a benchtop version for now.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/e4e5ba08c9a0945cdf09858e5761930a/2a4bc/planer.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 75.31645569620254%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"Planer\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/e4e5ba08c9a0945cdf09858e5761930a/f058b/planer.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/e4e5ba08c9a0945cdf09858e5761930a/c26ae/planer.png 158w,\n/static/e4e5ba08c9a0945cdf09858e5761930a/6bdcf/planer.png 315w,\n/static/e4e5ba08c9a0945cdf09858e5761930a/f058b/planer.png 630w,\n/static/e4e5ba08c9a0945cdf09858e5761930a/40601/planer.png 945w,\n/static/e4e5ba08c9a0945cdf09858e5761930a/78612/planer.png 1260w,\n/static/e4e5ba08c9a0945cdf09858e5761930a/2a4bc/planer.png 3264w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>Paired with the jointer, this DeWalt planer completes the milling duo.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/061a53ed7f5a1987204b15731e0f5d91/2a4bc/router.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 75.31645569620254%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"Router Table\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/061a53ed7f5a1987204b15731e0f5d91/f058b/router.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/061a53ed7f5a1987204b15731e0f5d91/c26ae/router.png 158w,\n/static/061a53ed7f5a1987204b15731e0f5d91/6bdcf/router.png 315w,\n/static/061a53ed7f5a1987204b15731e0f5d91/f058b/router.png 630w,\n/static/061a53ed7f5a1987204b15731e0f5d91/40601/router.png 945w,\n/static/061a53ed7f5a1987204b15731e0f5d91/78612/router.png 1260w,\n/static/061a53ed7f5a1987204b15731e0f5d91/2a4bc/router.png 3264w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>Finally, the Bosch router table rounded out the initial lineup. Edge profiles, dados, rabbets… the router table opened up a world of joinery and decorative possibilities.</p>\n<p>With this cast assembled, the shop was ready for its first real project. The tools sat waiting, full of potential, ready to transform rough lumber into something meaningful.</p>","frontmatter":{"title":"The Leading Cast of Tools","date":"October 29, 2017","description":null}},"previous":{"fields":{"slug":"/005-first-project-frames/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"First Project - Fly Fishing Frames"}},"next":{"fields":{"slug":"/006-pop-tops/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Pop Tops"}}},"pageContext":{"id":"9450d3aa-3503-5eb5-9cab-dded12214fdc","previousPostId":"f2c8fc0b-dfc6-54b4-a6ec-682b5f7a3537","nextPostId":"ec4a9937-e38d-595c-9ba8-02146eff243c"}},"staticQueryHashes":["2841359383"],"slicesMap":{}}